---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Solutions | Sovrin Group" section="solutions">
  <div class="dark-zone page-dark page-flow">
  <section class="hero-page">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker">Solutions</p>
      <h1>Building Trust Through Clarity, Continuity, and Confidence</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Organizations operate in an increasingly complex environment of people, technology, processes, and information. As complexity grows, trust becomes harder to establish, maintain, and verify.
        </p>
        <p>
          Sovrin helps organizations reduce uncertainty and strengthen trust through foundational solutions that address identity, continuity, and operational consistency.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether the challenge is understanding who is accountable, preserving critical knowledge and capabilities, or ensuring systems produce reliable outcomes, Sovrin provides practical and structured approaches to help organizations operate with greater confidence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top: 2.4rem;">
        <a class="card" href="/solutions/systems/">
          <div class="card-icon"><img src="/images/glyph-contour-s.png" alt="" /></div>
          <h2>Deterministic Systems</h2>
          <p>Deliver trust through transparent, repeatable, and verifiable outcomes that reduce uncertainty and improve confidence.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/solutions/identity/">
          <div class="card-icon"><img src="/images/glyph-mp-i.png" alt="" /></div>
          <h2>Unified Identity</h2>
          <p>Establish trust through a clear understanding of people, systems, applications, devices, and organizational relationships.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/solutions/continuity/">
          <div class="card-icon"><img src="/images/glyph-arrow-fg.png" alt="" /></div>
          <h2>Governed Continuity</h2>
          <p>Sustain trust through governance, accountability, stewardship, and resilient operating practices.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  </div>
</Base>
